# Tagging run on every card in the starter decks (10 decks, 353 distinct cards, 353 tagged, 0 without a script). Sources in order of trust: card script, mtgish, Forge AI. Rules: human_logic.toon H50-H55, design deckgen/TAG_LINKS.md. Tags run supertype, cardtype, subtype/landtype, kw + qualifiers, ability tags. duration:eot(forge_default) = a Pump with no Duration (Forge removes it at end of turn). Generated by deckgen/tag_run.py; research output, no card or deck was changed.

card: "Nazar, the Velvet Fang"
tags: supertype:legendary cardtype:creature type:vampire type:warlock kw:menace draw evasion counter:feeding trigger:attacks tempo:+3 draw_count:3 life_loss trigger:gain_life
clauses[2]{id,trigger,cost,verb,payload,affected,duration}:
  c1,gain_life,"",putcounter,countertype=FEEDING,Defined=Self,""
  c2,attacks,"",draw+loselife,numcards=3 lifeamount=3,Defined=You Defined=You,""
links[2]{from,rel,to}:
  c1:affected,receives,c1:payload
  c2:affected,receives,c2:payload
groups[5]{id,source,tags}:
  k1,K line,kw:menace
  c1.2,sub-ability of c1,counter:feeding
  c2,T line,trigger:attacks tempo:+3
  c2.2,sub-ability of c2,draw_count:3
  v,cross-check (oracle/mtgish/keyword/ai),life_loss trigger:gain_life
mtgish: rules=Menace TriggerA TriggerA
verify_flags: cost cost:remove_counters from mtgish only
forge_ai: AILogic=-

